{# The brand line on a product tile: name only, no logo.

   A tile is small and already carries a product image; a second image competes with it.

   `madcoders_tile_brand()` rather than reading `product.brand` directly: it answers from a set
   loaded once per page instead of initialising a Doctrine proxy per tile, and it already applies
   the feature toggle, the brand's own enabled flag and its tile toggle. See BrandRuntime. #}
{% set product = product ?? hookable_metadata.context.product ?? null %}
{% set brand = madcoders_tile_brand(product) %}

{% if brand is not null %}
    <div class="text-muted small text-uppercase" {{ sylius_test_html_attribute('madcoders-tile-brand') }}>
        {% include '@MadcodersSyliusBrandPlugin/shop/brand/_link.html.twig' with { brand: brand, class: 'text-reset text-decoration-none' } only %}
    </div>
{% endif %}
